      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "I’ll attach the E2E Long (experimental mode) graphs included in the pull request here for record-keeping.\nThe x-axis represents time, and the y-axis represents the accelerator command (desired acceleration).\nPositive values indicate acceleration, while negative values indicate deceleration (braking).\nSince openpilot runs at 20 Hz, 60 frames correspond to approximately 3 seconds.",
